<title>UK: Raine swings to H1 profit.</title>
<headline>Raine swings to H1 profit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>			 (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		0.34		   vs 0.79 loss</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    1.07		   vs 1.35 loss</p>
<p> Net borrowings	   32.7		   down 20.7</p>
<p> Turnover		   189.9		  vs 223.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the British-based housebuilding and contracting group is Raine Plc. The company said it looked forward to the &quot;eventual resumption&quot; of dividend payments.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
